OL,3,GNEWSAPolice station nurse cleared over
OL,4,Adetainee death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nurse on duty in a police station
OL,7,Fwhen an arrested man died in a cell has
OL,8,Fbeen cleared of manslaughter and of
OL,9,Fbreaching health and safety law.
OL,11,FSean Cregg was the designated
OL,12,Fhealthcare professional at Loddon
OL,13,FValley police station, in Reading, on 8
OL,14,FJanuary 2020 when William Cameron was
OL,15,Farrested on suspicion of assault.
OL,17,FCregg told a jury he assessed the
OL,18,F38-year-old when he was brought in, but
OL,19,Fdecided he was faking unconsciousness
OL,20,Fand being "obstructive".
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
