OL,3,GNEWSAPolice station nurse cleared over
OL,4,Adetainee death
OL,5,
OL,6,FCameron later died of a heart attack
OL,7,Fcaused by a mix of alcohol, methadone
OL,8,Fand other drugs, the jury heard.
